  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tPayroll\n\t\tPayroll FAQs\n\n### Can I bulk download payroll record and reports for more than one client?\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Fri, 6 Aug, 2021 at 11:09 AM\n\n\t\tYes! Please navigate to Payroll > Dashboard\n\nPayroll Records\n\nClick on PAYE Clients\nCheck the tick box on the left hand side of the clients you want to download a report\nClick on download\nA CSV will download with the PAYE payroll data for all clients selected\n\nBulk Reports\n\nClick on PAYE Clients\nCheck the tick box on the left hand side of the clients you want to download a report\nClick on Export Report\nA pop up will appear\n\nPlease select from the dropdown boxes\n\nFrom here you can download as PDF or email the reports\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115223\">Payroll</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188558\">Payroll FAQs</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Can I bulk download payroll record and reports for more than one client?\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Fri, 6 Aug, 2021 at 11:09 AM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\">Yes! Please navigate to Payroll &gt; Dashboard</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong><br></strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Payroll Records</strong></p><ol><li dir=\"ltr\">Click on PAYE Clients</li><li dir=\"ltr\">Check the tick box on the left hand side of the clients you want to download a report</li><li dir=\"ltr\">Click on download</li><li dir=\"ltr\">A CSV will download with the PAYE payroll data for all clients selected</li></ol><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9136392390/original/8HHHDMNsp39AxhKtw5aRUmkoF_UsvZhS5g.png?1628244172\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9136392390\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Bulk Reports</strong></p><ol><li dir=\"ltr\">Click on PAYE Clients</li><li dir=\"ltr\">Check the tick box on the left hand side of the clients you want to download a report</li><li dir=\"ltr\">Click on Export Report</li><li dir=\"ltr\">A pop up will appear</li></ol><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9136392600/original/VQXWMXxSp0XmNYXeUNp7p-6sE98KJ-Wkog.png?1628244431\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9136392600\"></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Please select from the dropdown boxes</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">From here you can download as PDF or email the reports</p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9136392651/original/eM2gJeMJzwA82lHhE2IkL1S6cvLzVhiRCQ.png?1628244482\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9136392651\"></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000205139\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000205139/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000205139\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000205139/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#vote-feedback-form\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000205139\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-hide-dom=\"#voting-container\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo</span></s